	"data": "Concept: Solid Pod Encryption Layer\n\nWhat It Is\n\nA client-side encryption layer for Solid Pod data that supplements the protocol's built-in access control (WAC/ACP) with true data confidentiality. Solid's WAC controls who can reach a resource. This encryption layer controls what the data means even if someone gets it.\n\nDesign principle: Layer the defenses. Be honest about where the trust boundary sits. Give users maximum tools to protect their data. The rest is the user's responsibility for who…",
